{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic宣佈今日啓動A類普通股首次公開發行（IPO）路演，預計將於下周三定價，並於周四開始交易，IPO目標估值約1萬億美元。發行價區間預計為每股70–78美元。公司已申請在納斯達克全球精選市場上市，股票代碼ANT。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585808.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T14:41:55.917382+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T14:29:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:20.071021+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:20.071021+00:00","content_hash":"edacc018b496681901d429ce4dbc8d08063899addaf8882b00a8ce09a682e186","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}